<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Hoyts year net loss A$78.09 mln.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Hoyts year net loss A$78.09 mln.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to June 30</p>
<p>		 (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit		     profit 28.36</p>
<p>    Net					  loss 78.09</p>
<p>    Abnormal items			   loss 111.85</p>
<p>    Sales					     331.28</p>
<p>    Final dividend				  nil</p>
<p>NOTE: Hoyts Ltd is a cinema operator which listed on the Australian Stock Exchange on August 28. Company is 47.5 percent owned by U.S.-based Hellman and Friedman Capital. Staff hold 22.5 percent and Lend Lease 9.5 percent.</p>
</text>
